1
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:11,908
[rain pattering]

2
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,205
[Hocheol] Hey, who are you?

3
00:00:18,707 --> 00:00:21,877
You fucking bastard!
Actually, actually, you know what?

4
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,378
Forget it.

5
00:00:23,462 --> 00:00:25,631
I don't really care who you are.
It doesn't matter.

6
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:27,799
And I won't try to find out, either.

7
00:00:29,176 --> 00:00:32,846
Just give me back the van.
Turn around and come back.

8
00:00:32,929 --> 00:00:34,598
I'm gonna find you tonight anyway.

9
00:00:34,681 --> 00:00:36,600
[scared breathing]

10
00:00:36,683 --> 00:00:37,934
[Hocheol] Then you're done.

11
00:00:40,729 --> 00:00:43,023
[panicked breathing]

12
00:00:50,614 --> 00:00:52,282
[distant thunder cracks]

13
00:00:56,453 --> 00:00:59,456
[grunting and whimpering]

14
00:01:18,684 --> 00:01:21,853
[♪ tense music]

15
00:01:21,937 --> 00:01:26,650
HAPPY! GANGWON

16
00:02:10,527 --> 00:02:15,741
EPISODE 1
BETTING

17
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:31,673
[doorbell rings quietly]

18
00:02:32,424 --> 00:02:33,467
[grunts]

19
00:02:35,427 --> 00:02:38,430
[doorbell rings quietly]

20
00:02:39,222 --> 00:02:41,683
[groans]

21
00:02:43,143 --> 00:02:44,770
[door beeps]

22
00:02:45,562 --> 00:02:48,064
[Landlady] Hi there.
Is the captain at home?

23
00:02:48,815 --> 00:02:51,693
Oh, he's away for work right now.

24
00:02:51,777 --> 00:02:54,154
Oh, is that right?

25
00:02:55,405 --> 00:02:59,868
It's just, well, the rent.
It's really overdue.

26
00:02:59,951 --> 00:03:02,621
It's been over three months now, right?

27
00:03:02,704 --> 00:03:05,165
You know, we're not just talking about one
or two months.

28
00:03:05,248 --> 00:03:06,750
We're talking about three months.

29
00:03:06,833 --> 00:03:10,545
Look, if he's going through something,
I understand, but...

30
00:03:10,629 --> 00:03:11,630
[inhales sharply]

31
00:03:13,006 --> 00:03:15,008
[Landlady] He could at least tell me
what's going on.

32
00:03:15,091 --> 00:03:16,092
[exhales]

33
00:03:17,135 --> 00:03:19,763
Instead, he ignores all
my calls and my texts.

34
00:03:19,846 --> 00:03:22,265
You two aren't having any problems
or anything, are you?

35
00:03:22,933 --> 00:03:24,851
I know I shouldn't say this to you.

36
00:03:24,935 --> 00:03:26,269
Tell him for me?

37
00:03:30,232 --> 00:03:31,942
CONNECTING CALL...
DOKYUNG

38
00:03:32,025 --> 00:03:35,028
[phone trilling]

39
00:03:35,529 --> 00:03:38,198
[Operator] Your call has been forwarded
to an automated voice messaging...

40
00:03:38,281 --> 00:03:39,699
[phone beeps]

41
00:03:41,076 --> 00:03:45,580
YOU'RE COMING TODAY, RIGHT?

42
00:03:45,664 --> 00:03:49,209
[Man on TV] You're going
to absolutely love this trip.

43
00:03:49,292 --> 00:03:53,505
THE LANDLADY CAME BY ABOUT THE RENT.

44
00:03:53,588 --> 00:03:58,009
[Man on TV] Home to the Mona Lisa.
This is the best that Europe has to offer.

45
00:03:58,093 --> 00:04:04,474
TRAVEL SAFE. SEE YOU LATER

46
00:04:04,558 --> 00:04:08,186
[Woman on TV] Enjoy an easy, rewarding,
and comfortable experience.

47
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:09,437
And for those of you...

48
00:04:09,521 --> 00:04:12,232
ARRIVING AT 3:00 O'CLOCK

49
00:04:12,315 --> 00:04:13,567
[machine beeping]

50
00:04:14,568 --> 00:04:16,778
I'm sorry but this card was declined.

51
00:04:16,861 --> 00:04:18,071
Are you sure?

52
00:04:18,154 --> 00:04:19,739
Could you just try it one more time,
please?
STYLE
::cue()

53
00:04:22,033 --> 00:04:23,118
[machine beeping]

54
00:04:25,245 --> 00:04:26,246
It's not going through.

55
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:30,417
Uh, how much is the total?

56
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,460
[Female Automated Voice] Welcome.

57
00:04:32,544 --> 00:04:35,797
Please press the number of the transaction
you would like to complete.

58
00:04:35,881 --> 00:04:37,424
Please enter the amount you...
[button clicks]

59
00:04:37,507 --> 00:04:38,633
NOTICE: INSUFFICIENT ACCOUNT BALANCE.
AVAILABLE BALANCE: KRW 0.

60
00:04:38,717 --> 00:04:40,010
PLEASE CHECK YOUR AVAILABLE BALANCE
BEFORE PROCEEDING WITH THE TRANSACTION.

61
00:04:40,093 --> 00:04:41,553
[Female Automated Voice]
Please take your card.

62
00:04:46,182 --> 00:04:47,851
[distant traffic passing]

63
00:04:49,102 --> 00:04:52,105
[♪ melancholic music]

64
00:05:04,534 --> 00:05:08,246
YOU'RE COMING TODAY, RIGHT?
TRAVEL SAFE. SEE YOU LATER

65
00:05:09,873 --> 00:05:10,874
[exhales sharply]

66
00:05:11,708 --> 00:05:12,834
[cell phone vibrating]

67
00:05:15,587 --> 00:05:18,006
[Dokyung] See you soon.
I love you.

68
00:05:18,632 --> 00:05:19,633
[exhales]

69
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,261
[Heeju] Love you.

70
00:05:24,638 --> 00:05:27,390
[inhales and exhales deeply]

71
00:05:28,308 --> 00:05:31,311
[jet engines roaring]

72
00:05:34,356 --> 00:05:36,274
INTERNATIONAL ARRIVALS

73
00:05:36,358 --> 00:05:39,861
[indistinct chatter]

74
00:05:44,157 --> 00:05:46,201
A404 THAILAND/SUVARNABHUMI
15:00 ARRIVED

75
00:05:46,284 --> 00:05:48,078
[Female Announcer] Attention, passengers.

76
00:05:48,161 --> 00:05:51,539
Final boarding call
for flight 407 to Tokyo.

77
00:05:51,623 --> 00:05:53,875
[indistinct chatter]

78
00:06:04,552 --> 00:06:07,681
[Cheoljung] Hi. I have a question.
Do you know this woman?

79
00:06:07,764 --> 00:06:09,099
[Cheoljung] She works here.

80
00:06:09,182 --> 00:06:10,475
[quiet gasping]

81
00:06:13,770 --> 00:06:16,773
[machines rattling]

82
00:06:18,483 --> 00:06:21,027
[Female Security Officer A] Yes,
we were able to make note

83
00:06:21,111 --> 00:06:22,570
of this shipment but we still have...

84
00:06:22,654 --> 00:06:23,697
[machine beeping]

85
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:24,948
X-RAY WARNING: WHEN THE EQUIPMENT
IS IN OPERATION,

86
00:06:25,031 --> 00:06:26,324
DO NOT PLACE ANY PART OF YOUR BODY
INSIDE UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES

87
00:06:26,408 --> 00:06:27,659
NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY

88
00:06:27,742 --> 00:06:29,411
[Yujin] Belt two, unload the cargo.

89
00:06:31,287 --> 00:06:32,539
[Female Security Officer C]
Which one is it?

90
00:06:32,622 --> 00:06:36,292
[alarm ringing]

91
00:06:36,376 --> 00:06:37,377
[claps]

92
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,629
[Female Security Officer A gasps]
That's right!

93
00:06:39,713 --> 00:06:41,131
Aren't you off this weekend?

94
00:06:41,214 --> 00:06:44,134
We're all going to Sokcho to check out
this hot new night club.

95
00:06:44,217 --> 00:06:45,760
You should come with us!

96
00:06:45,844 --> 00:06:47,262
I've got things to do at home.

97
00:06:47,345 --> 00:06:48,972
[Female Security Officer B]
Oh, come on. No, you don't.

98
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:51,850
You can't just be cooped up here all
the time.

99
00:06:51,933 --> 00:06:53,685
[Female Security Officer B]
You gotta go out and have fun, too.

100
00:06:53,768 --> 00:06:55,645
Sorry, guys.
I'll join you on the next one.

101
00:06:55,729 --> 00:06:57,647
[all laughing]
She plays hard to get, doesn't she?

102
00:06:57,731 --> 00:06:59,482
[knocking]

103
00:06:59,566 --> 00:07:00,817
You're not here to fool around.

104
00:07:04,779 --> 00:07:05,989
[Yujin] Not without me, you aren't.

105
00:07:06,072 --> 00:07:06,823
[all giggling]

106
00:07:06,906 --> 00:07:08,658
[Female Security Officer A]
Of course you have to come with us!

107
00:07:08,742 --> 00:07:09,576
Where would we go without you?

108
00:07:09,659 --> 00:07:10,702
So where are we going?

109
00:07:10,785 --> 00:07:12,996
[Female Security Officer B]
We're gonna go clubbing, duh!

110
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:14,164
Wait, Heeju.

111
00:07:14,247 --> 00:07:17,041
-Can we talk for a minute?
-Oh, okay.

112
00:07:23,715 --> 00:07:24,924
Earlier today...

113
00:07:25,675 --> 00:07:27,552
This guy came by and said he
was your uncle.

114
00:07:28,636 --> 00:07:32,599
[Yujin] He showed me an old school photo
of you and asked if I knew you.

115
00:07:32,682 --> 00:07:35,769
He said that an acquaintance of his saw
you working here in your security uniform.

116
00:07:36,811 --> 00:07:39,022
So what did you tell him?

117
00:07:39,105 --> 00:07:40,356
That no one here looks like that.

118
00:07:41,733 --> 00:07:44,444
If he doesn't know,
there's gotta be a reason, right?

119
00:07:45,195 --> 00:07:46,404
Is he really your uncle?

120
00:07:47,739 --> 00:07:48,823
No, he's not.

121
00:07:50,408 --> 00:07:51,409
I thought so.

122
00:07:52,702 --> 00:07:55,121
He just seems kinda odd.

123
00:07:57,499 --> 00:07:58,792
[Yujin] Who was he?

124
00:07:58,875 --> 00:08:01,044
Did you get mixed up with a loan shark?

125
00:08:01,127 --> 00:08:04,339
Uh, no.
It's nothing like that.

126
00:08:04,422 --> 00:08:05,423
Then who was it?

127
00:08:06,174 --> 00:08:07,842
Tell me and maybe I can help you.

128
00:08:07,926 --> 00:08:10,428
You hardly ever talk about yourself.

129
00:08:11,221 --> 00:08:13,223
I'm sorry.
Can I ask...

130
00:08:14,432 --> 00:08:18,728
If that man ever comes back,
could you tell him I don't work here?

131
00:08:19,646 --> 00:08:20,730
I can do that.

132
00:08:22,774 --> 00:08:25,360
Just be careful outside of work, too.

133
00:08:25,902 --> 00:08:27,779
[Yujin] Word of advice.

134
00:08:27,862 --> 00:08:30,865
[Yujin] If you didn't do anything wrong,
don't run away.

135
00:08:30,949 --> 00:08:35,245
Once you start running from guys like him,
you'll end up running your whole life.

136
00:08:38,289 --> 00:08:39,290
Yes.

137
00:08:40,124 --> 00:08:41,626
I appreciate it, ma'am.
STYLE
::cue()

138
00:08:42,710 --> 00:08:45,713
[traffic bustling]

139
00:08:46,548 --> 00:08:49,801
[engines revving]

140
00:08:49,884 --> 00:08:52,846
[car horns honking]

141
00:09:39,392 --> 00:09:40,768
[Woojin whistling]

142
00:09:40,852 --> 00:09:42,687
[exhales]
What do you guys want?

143
00:09:43,813 --> 00:09:46,107
You just had to come all this way here
to find me? Really?

144
00:09:47,942 --> 00:09:48,943
You're a difficult man to reach.

145
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:58,453
Look, I always repay Geumseong back,
don't I?

146
00:09:59,287 --> 00:10:00,371
I heard it's been a year.

147
00:10:04,876 --> 00:10:06,461
Let's talk it over in Jeongsan.

148
00:10:08,046 --> 00:10:10,173
Well, let's say you go back
to Jeongsan now.

149
00:10:10,924 --> 00:10:14,052
[Woojin] The boys here will have
to clean you out.

150
00:10:15,011 --> 00:10:17,305
Your organs.
They're healthy, right?

151
00:10:18,306 --> 00:10:19,307
What?

152
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:21,017
It's a joke, man. A joke.

153
00:10:21,684 --> 00:10:23,061
[Woojin] We wouldn't do that to you.

154
00:10:23,645 --> 00:10:24,646
We'll be partners.

155
00:10:25,230 --> 00:10:26,814
Forever and ever.

156
00:10:32,028 --> 00:10:33,196
What do you want me to do now?

157
00:10:34,447 --> 00:10:35,448
Hold your questions.

158
00:10:36,616 --> 00:10:39,244
First up, we need
to check your collateral.

159
00:10:41,996 --> 00:10:43,122
[exhales sharply]

160
00:10:43,206 --> 00:10:46,834
[phone buzzing]

161
00:10:46,918 --> 00:10:48,211
Where have you been?

162
00:10:48,294 --> 00:10:49,545
[Dokyung] I'm still in Bangkok.

163
00:10:50,255 --> 00:10:51,256
What?

164
00:10:52,298 --> 00:10:54,050
-[Heeju] What are you still doing there?
-I'll tell you later.

165
00:10:54,133 --> 00:10:55,468
Where are you now?
Are you home?

166
00:10:56,302 --> 00:10:57,845
[Heeju] Yeah. I just walked in.

167
00:10:57,929 --> 00:10:59,180
Get out of the house right now, Heeju.

168
00:10:59,264 --> 00:11:01,474
What? Why?

169
00:11:01,557 --> 00:11:03,393
[Dokyung] There's no time.
Just get out right now.

170
00:11:03,476 --> 00:11:07,230
Grab whatever you need, clothes, photos,
and get out of there.

171
00:11:07,313 --> 00:11:09,232
Some people are headed
over there right now.

172
00:11:10,233 --> 00:11:11,734
They can't know that you're there.

173
00:11:11,818 --> 00:11:13,444
Some people? Who?

174
00:11:13,528 --> 00:11:15,822
[Dokyung] There's no time to explain!
Just go!

175
00:11:15,905 --> 00:11:17,949
-[Dokyung] Call me after you've left.
-What are you talking about?

176
00:11:18,032 --> 00:11:19,575
H-hello?

177
00:11:26,708 --> 00:11:29,544
[erratic breathing]

178
00:11:29,627 --> 00:11:31,254
Pictures.

179
00:11:32,505 --> 00:11:34,048
Oh, my passport.

180
00:11:34,757 --> 00:11:35,883
Got it.

181
00:11:36,301 --> 00:11:37,885
[doorbell ringing]
[gasps]

182
00:11:37,969 --> 00:11:39,804
[knocking on door]

183
00:11:41,556 --> 00:11:43,141
[ringing and knocking continues]

184
00:11:45,143 --> 00:11:47,395
[beeping]

185
00:11:49,314 --> 00:11:51,983
[Thug A] What the fuck?
Someone lives here.

186
00:11:52,483 --> 00:11:53,651
[Thug B] Ah, dammit.

187
00:11:53,735 --> 00:11:56,612
[Thug C] Hello? Is anyone here?

188
00:11:57,238 --> 00:11:59,574
[Thug A] Look around.
What is this?

189
00:11:59,657 --> 00:12:01,159
[exhales sharply]

190
00:12:01,242 --> 00:12:03,536
-Go check the balcony.
-Ah, shit.
STYLE
::cue()

191
00:12:08,624 --> 00:12:09,876
Nothing here.

192
00:12:10,585 --> 00:12:11,711
[Thug C] You checked everything?

193
00:12:12,295 --> 00:12:16,215
[Thug C] Ah, shit.
Where the hell are they, dammit?

194
00:12:16,299 --> 00:12:17,717
[Thug A] Did you go in there?

195
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,510
[groans]

196
00:12:19,594 --> 00:12:23,639
[whimpering]

197
00:12:26,768 --> 00:12:30,063
[breathing erratically]

198
00:12:36,736 --> 00:12:39,197
[cell phone vibrates]

199
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:41,491
[gasps]

200
00:12:41,574 --> 00:12:43,409
-Heeju, where are you right now?
-[Heeju] I'm on the bus.

201
00:12:44,243 --> 00:12:45,370
[exhales sharply]

202
00:12:45,453 --> 00:12:47,038
[Heeju] You need to tell me
what's going on.

203
00:12:47,121 --> 00:12:48,373
What do those people want with you?

204
00:12:48,456 --> 00:12:50,208
[Dokyung] Don't worry about them.
It's nothing.

205
00:12:50,291 --> 00:12:52,627
You don't think it's a big deal that
a group of strange men

206
00:12:52,710 --> 00:12:53,961
just barged in through the door?

207
00:12:54,754 --> 00:12:55,755
[exhales]

208
00:12:57,173 --> 00:12:59,550
Talk to me.
What's going on?

209
00:12:59,634 --> 00:13:01,219
I already told you it's okay.

210
00:13:01,302 --> 00:13:02,887
You don't need to worry about it.

211
00:13:02,970 --> 00:13:04,639
[Heeju] Your credit card has been frozen,

212
00:13:04,722 --> 00:13:06,933
and I learned your rent
is overdue by three months.

213
00:13:07,767 --> 00:13:09,977
The landlady came by asking for you.

214
00:13:10,853 --> 00:13:13,606
[Heeju] Dokyung, are you still gambling?

215
00:13:14,941 --> 00:13:16,651
Did you use a loan shark?

216
00:13:16,734 --> 00:13:20,655
[Dokyung] Yeah, I went to a casino
with my friends last year.

217
00:13:21,781 --> 00:13:23,157
How much?

218
00:13:23,241 --> 00:13:24,867
[Heeju] I have a little bit
of money saved.

219
00:13:25,618 --> 00:13:26,619
[exhales sharply]

220
00:13:26,702 --> 00:13:29,288
It wasn't much.
And I paid it off.

221
00:13:29,372 --> 00:13:31,290
[Heeju] Then why did those people come?

222
00:13:31,374 --> 00:13:33,209
[Dokyung] I just paid them back now.

223
00:13:34,627 --> 00:13:37,171
Well then, can I just go back?

224
00:13:38,172 --> 00:13:40,049
No, stay at a hotel.
I'll be there tomorrow.

225
00:13:40,883 --> 00:13:43,052
I know I was supposed to be back today.

226
00:13:43,136 --> 00:13:46,180
But there were some complications
that came up.

227
00:13:46,264 --> 00:13:48,808
Basically, this chairman I know
who lives in Cambodia.

228
00:13:48,891 --> 00:13:49,976
He's Korean.

229
00:13:50,059 --> 00:13:52,854
[Dokyung] And one of his employees
actually passed away in

230
00:13:52,937 --> 00:13:54,188
an accident over here.

231
00:13:54,814 --> 00:13:57,316
We need to ship his body back
to Korea by tomorrow.

232
00:13:58,818 --> 00:14:01,320
But you know how that stuff
can be complicated.

233
00:14:01,404 --> 00:14:03,364
So he called me to ask
if I could help out.

234
00:14:03,447 --> 00:14:06,367
[Heeju] I see.
Are you sure everything's okay?

235
00:14:07,368 --> 00:14:08,911
Nothing will happen to us, right?

236
00:14:09,996 --> 00:14:12,623
[Dokyung] Everything will be fine.
Just trust me.

237
00:14:13,541 --> 00:14:15,042
But Heeju?

238
00:14:15,126 --> 00:14:17,086
I do have one small favor to ask.

239
00:14:19,547 --> 00:14:21,883
The, uh, casket,
the one I'm shipping tomorrow...

240
00:14:22,717 --> 00:14:25,761
Would you be able to handle
the airport security check?

241
00:14:25,845 --> 00:14:27,096
I'm off tomorrow.

242
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:28,973
[Dokyung] But you can swap shifts
with someone.

243
00:14:29,056 --> 00:14:32,101
I need you to make sure the casket
gets past the checkpoint, okay?

244
00:14:32,185 --> 00:14:36,397
And if the scanners should see something,
just let it through.

245
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,899
[Heeju] Why? What's in it?

246
00:14:37,982 --> 00:14:39,650
[Dokyung] I'm just saying,
in case something goes wrong.

247
00:14:39,734 --> 00:14:42,445
Okay. What could go wrong?

248
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,281
Nothing.

249
00:14:47,158 --> 00:14:48,159
Trust me, Heeju.

250
00:14:50,161 --> 00:14:51,787
Do what I tell you to do.

251
00:14:51,871 --> 00:14:53,873
[Dokyung] Shoot, the chairman is here.

252
00:14:53,956 --> 00:14:56,292
I need to go.
Please don't forget.

253
00:14:56,834 --> 00:14:58,127
Flight A404.

254
00:14:58,211 --> 00:15:01,839
It's departing from Siem Riep
at 7:00 A.M. tomorrow, 'kay?

255
00:15:03,424 --> 00:15:04,550
Love you.

256
00:15:04,634 --> 00:15:05,968
[phone clicks]

257
00:15:06,052 --> 00:15:07,803
Yeah, love you-
[phone beeps]

258
00:15:11,390 --> 00:15:13,351
[exhales sharply]

259
00:15:20,524 --> 00:15:23,527
[♪ suspenseful music]
STYLE
::cue()

260
00:15:28,574 --> 00:15:31,577
[jet engine roaring]

261
00:15:33,496 --> 00:15:36,499
[footsteps echoing]

262
00:15:50,179 --> 00:15:51,555
[nervous chuckle]

263
00:15:51,639 --> 00:15:53,474
-Hi, you guys.
-[Female Security Officer A] Hi, Heeju!

264
00:15:53,557 --> 00:15:55,268
-Hi.
-Come on. Just ask her.

265
00:15:56,143 --> 00:15:57,395
Weren't you off today?

266
00:15:57,478 --> 00:16:00,439
Uh, Yerim and I changed shifts.

267
00:16:00,523 --> 00:16:01,732
Really? Why? Is she okay?

268
00:16:01,816 --> 00:16:02,817
I don't know.

269
00:16:03,234 --> 00:16:05,695
[machine beeps]
Weird. It's not like her to miss a shift.

270
00:16:05,778 --> 00:16:07,488
[Female Security Officer C] Right?
Have you heard anything?

271
00:16:07,571 --> 00:16:10,574
[machines clacking]

272
00:16:10,658 --> 00:16:13,661
[machine beeping]

273
00:16:15,496 --> 00:16:17,581
[inhales and exhales]

274
00:16:17,665 --> 00:16:20,251
[♪ tense, percussive music]

275
00:16:25,256 --> 00:16:26,632
RADIATION CONTROLLED AREA
[OPERATING FACILITY]

276
00:16:26,716 --> 00:16:28,009
NO UNAUTHORIZED ENTRY

277
00:16:28,843 --> 00:16:32,430
[thumping]

278
00:16:32,513 --> 00:16:35,474
[machine belt groaning]

279
00:16:40,354 --> 00:16:43,357
[coffin creaks]

280
00:17:14,764 --> 00:17:17,975
[machine beeping]

281
00:17:19,435 --> 00:17:21,020
What's going on with belt two?

282
00:17:21,854 --> 00:17:24,899
It's all the metal decorations attached
to the casket.

283
00:17:32,114 --> 00:17:33,699
[Yujin] Heeju.

284
00:17:34,867 --> 00:17:35,993
Let it go through.

285
00:17:37,119 --> 00:17:38,120
Okay.

286
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:43,209
[belt clanging]

287
00:17:46,754 --> 00:17:48,506
[casket groaning]

288
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:56,013
[all grunting]

289
00:17:58,474 --> 00:17:59,517
[Thug A] One, two, three.

290
00:18:00,434 --> 00:18:03,270
[scraping]

291
00:18:03,354 --> 00:18:05,815
[all exhaling]

292
00:18:05,898 --> 00:18:07,316
[belt strap pulling]

293
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,652
[buckle clicks]

294
00:18:14,699 --> 00:18:17,702
[engines revving]

295
00:18:30,715 --> 00:18:33,718
[Dokyung fumbling with bag]

296
00:18:34,802 --> 00:18:36,095
Long time no see, Captain.

297
00:18:37,805 --> 00:18:40,433
You haven't been to Gold Land much
these days, have you?

298
00:18:40,516 --> 00:18:41,851
You've been up to somethin' big.

299
00:18:41,934 --> 00:18:43,185
[laughs]

300
00:18:43,269 --> 00:18:46,689
If you need any dough,
just let me know and I can help you out.

301
00:18:48,023 --> 00:18:49,024
What am I saying?

302
00:18:50,401 --> 00:18:52,069
You don't need petty cash
from grunts like us.

303
00:18:52,737 --> 00:18:54,113
Sorry.
[chuckles]

304
00:18:54,196 --> 00:18:55,573
[sniffs sharply]

305
00:19:04,206 --> 00:19:05,791
[gun cocks]

306
00:19:06,625 --> 00:19:07,626
The hell is this?

307
00:19:07,710 --> 00:19:09,712
What's it look like?
It's a gun.

308
00:19:09,795 --> 00:19:11,172
[Dokyung] A real gun.

309
00:19:11,255 --> 00:19:12,757
It's fully loaded.
Wanna check?

310
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:14,049
What?

311
00:19:14,884 --> 00:19:16,343
Look. Look, that exit on the right.

312
00:19:16,427 --> 00:19:17,678
I need you to get off there.

313
00:19:17,762 --> 00:19:19,346
Captain, why are you...

314
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:22,099
Hey, fucking hell! Hold the wheel!
Hands on the fucking wheel!

315
00:19:22,183 --> 00:19:24,518
[Dokyung] Listen, we're gonna take
the next exit.

316
00:19:24,602 --> 00:19:26,812
-Just take the fucking exit.
-We can't-we can't do this.

317
00:19:26,896 --> 00:19:28,272
I said take the fucking exit, man!

318
00:19:28,355 --> 00:19:31,609
[tires squealing]

319
00:19:31,692 --> 00:19:34,361
[Moonsu] What the fuck?
Where are they going?

320
00:19:34,445 --> 00:19:35,446
[Moonsu] Who the fuck is driving?

321
00:19:36,447 --> 00:19:37,448
[Thug D] Woogy, sir.

322
00:19:37,531 --> 00:19:38,908
[Moonsu] Shit.
STYLE
::cue()

323
00:19:38,991 --> 00:19:41,994
[engine revving]

324
00:19:42,995 --> 00:19:44,455
BOSS

325
00:19:45,289 --> 00:19:48,167
[Dokyung] Hey. Eyes on the road.
Keep going.

326
00:19:49,293 --> 00:19:51,295
[vibrating continues]

327
00:19:51,378 --> 00:19:54,715
I said just focus on driving,
you fucking dumb ass!

328
00:19:55,591 --> 00:19:56,592
Oh, fuck.

329
00:20:08,395 --> 00:20:09,480
[tires squeak]

330
00:20:09,563 --> 00:20:11,190
[Dokyung] Get the fuck out, you asshole.

331
00:20:13,484 --> 00:20:14,819
-Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait, wait.
-What?

332
00:20:14,902 --> 00:20:16,779
Can I at least have my phone? Please?

333
00:20:16,862 --> 00:20:19,448
-Yeah. Call them.
-[grunts]

334
00:20:20,825 --> 00:20:23,828
[car engine revving]

335
00:20:24,411 --> 00:20:25,579
Shit.

336
00:20:25,663 --> 00:20:28,249
Fuckin' asshole!
Fuck you, man!

337
00:20:30,835 --> 00:20:32,628
[door creaks open and shut]

338
00:20:34,129 --> 00:20:35,130
What's going on?

339
00:20:36,215 --> 00:20:37,508
You even called in the boys.

340
00:20:38,425 --> 00:20:39,426
We gotta take care of some meat.

341
00:20:40,970 --> 00:20:41,971
A debtor?

342
00:20:43,722 --> 00:20:44,974
[Hocheol exhales sharply]

343
00:20:45,057 --> 00:20:46,392
Just cutting off parts or butchering?

344
00:20:46,475 --> 00:20:47,852
Butcher as usual.

345
00:20:47,935 --> 00:20:49,186
[drink pours]

346
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:51,522
Strip him clean
and hand it all over.

347
00:20:51,605 --> 00:20:53,482
We aren't really prepared for that.

348
00:20:53,566 --> 00:20:54,817
You could have warned us.

349
00:20:55,317 --> 00:20:57,152
-Hey, Seokgu!
-[Seokgu] Yes, boss.

350
00:20:57,236 --> 00:20:58,696
Call Mr. Jin and tell him to come over.

351
00:20:58,779 --> 00:21:00,698
-Tell him don't forget his tools.
-Right away, boss. Yes.

352
00:21:00,781 --> 00:21:03,868
[cell phone vibrating]

353
00:21:03,951 --> 00:21:04,952
Who's that?

354
00:21:06,287 --> 00:21:07,288
[laughing]

355
00:21:07,371 --> 00:21:08,914
INCOMING CALL
CAPTAIN LEE DOKYUNG

356
00:21:12,418 --> 00:21:14,295
Hey, Captain.
Have you arrived yet?

357
00:21:15,254 --> 00:21:16,255
Where you at?

358
00:21:16,839 --> 00:21:18,799
[Dokyung] Oh, I guess they haven't
let you know.

359
00:21:19,508 --> 00:21:21,385
I'm the one driving
the funeral van now.

360
00:21:22,636 --> 00:21:24,597
And I managed to shake off all your men.

361
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:27,266
The casket is safe,
so don't worry about that.

362
00:21:28,058 --> 00:21:29,059
Captain.

363
00:21:30,019 --> 00:21:32,187
What exactly are you saying?

364
00:21:32,271 --> 00:21:35,274
I owe Yes Money two hundred million won,
right?

365
00:21:35,357 --> 00:21:37,693
You agree to write it off
if I help move the casket.

366
00:21:38,485 --> 00:21:40,070
[Hocheol] 212 million.

367
00:21:40,154 --> 00:21:41,697
Well, close enough.

368
00:21:42,656 --> 00:21:45,701
I'm sorry to say,
I don't think that's gonna cut it.

369
00:21:47,286 --> 00:21:49,830
[Dokyung] Also, you really don't want me
hanging around in Korea, right?

370
00:21:50,456 --> 00:21:52,207
I want a billion won in cash.

371
00:21:53,375 --> 00:21:56,211
Then I'll return the casket
and quietly disappear.

372
00:21:58,672 --> 00:22:00,299
[Dokyung] I noticed it was pretty heavy.

373
00:22:01,717 --> 00:22:04,678
That's a lot of drugs.
Must be worth at least 10 billion.

374
00:22:04,762 --> 00:22:07,389
I'm risking my life
to transport this thing.

375
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,475
I want ten percent.

376
00:22:09,558 --> 00:22:12,519
Not a bad deal for shipping cost, right?

377
00:22:14,146 --> 00:22:15,773
You made yourself very clear.

378
00:22:18,317 --> 00:22:19,985
This is gonna take some time, though.

379
00:22:20,069 --> 00:22:22,237
I gotta get approval
from the chairman first.

380
00:22:22,988 --> 00:22:23,989
Then we have to prepare the cash.

381
00:22:24,073 --> 00:22:26,033
You can have up until midnight.

382
00:22:27,534 --> 00:22:29,203
I'll be waiting at Geumsong.

383
00:22:29,286 --> 00:22:30,996
[Dokyung] First I'll check the cash.

384
00:22:31,538 --> 00:22:33,499
And then I'll give you
the location of the van.

385
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,294
Okay. Let's do that.

386
00:22:40,631 --> 00:22:43,050
[inhales and exhales]

387
00:22:46,971 --> 00:22:49,974
[screaming]

388
00:22:50,808 --> 00:22:53,811
[labored breathing]

389
00:22:56,271 --> 00:22:58,023
Fuckin' bastard!

390
00:23:00,025 --> 00:23:02,236
[keyboard clacking]

391
00:23:02,319 --> 00:23:04,196
[cell phone vibrating]

392
00:23:12,538 --> 00:23:14,415
[groans]

393
00:23:15,416 --> 00:23:18,210
[Jinman] Kim Jinman,
Jeongsan Police Investigations.

394
00:23:18,877 --> 00:23:20,462
[Hocheol] It's Park Hocheol.

395
00:23:20,546 --> 00:23:22,548
I need you to track a phone for me.

396
00:23:22,631 --> 00:23:25,217
[Jinman] Whose phone?
What for?

397
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:27,302
That's none of your business.
You got until midnight.

398
00:23:27,386 --> 00:23:29,138
[Jinman] Oh, come on.

399
00:23:29,221 --> 00:23:31,473
You know that's not the kind
of thing I can do so easily.

400
00:23:32,391 --> 00:23:34,977
[Jinman] I mean, I have to get
a warrant and everything.

401
00:23:35,060 --> 00:23:37,062
[Jinman] It'd be illegal without one.

402
00:23:37,813 --> 00:23:39,440
It involves the Chairman.

403
00:23:40,315 --> 00:23:42,776
[exhales sharply]
Name and phone number.

404
00:23:43,318 --> 00:23:44,319
[Hocheol] Lee Dokyung.

405
00:23:45,154 --> 00:23:46,613
[Jinman] Lee Dokyung.
STYLE
::cue()

406
00:23:54,830 --> 00:23:57,166
[cell phone vibrating]

407
00:23:57,249 --> 00:23:58,208
MOBILE PHONE
DOKYUNG

408
00:23:59,126 --> 00:24:00,127
Hello?

409
00:24:02,921 --> 00:24:05,924
[crickets chirping]

410
00:24:18,729 --> 00:24:20,022
[car engine revving]

411
00:24:31,116 --> 00:24:34,119
[crickets chirping loudly]

412
00:24:41,126 --> 00:24:44,129
[erratic breathing]

413
00:24:53,138 --> 00:24:55,557
[headlights clicking]

414
00:24:56,850 --> 00:24:58,602
[door scrapes]

415
00:25:10,906 --> 00:25:13,742
[Dokyung] Heeju. Heeju.

416
00:25:13,826 --> 00:25:15,369
-Dokyung.
-[Dokyung] Heeju.

417
00:25:18,247 --> 00:25:20,040
[Dokyung] Get in.

418
00:25:20,124 --> 00:25:21,416
[both breathing heavily]

419
00:25:21,500 --> 00:25:22,709
Oh, Heeju!

420
00:25:22,793 --> 00:25:23,961
It's okay. It's okay.

421
00:25:24,044 --> 00:25:25,671
[Dokyung] You must have been scared.

422
00:25:25,754 --> 00:25:26,922
[Heeju] Mm-hmm.

423
00:25:27,005 --> 00:25:28,006
[Dokyung] It's all right.

424
00:25:30,717 --> 00:25:32,261
-You left your phone, right?
-Mm-hmm.

425
00:25:34,388 --> 00:25:36,807
[Dokyung] From now on
we only use these, okay?

426
00:25:36,890 --> 00:25:39,935
[Dokyung] I need you to listen
to me very carefully, Heeju.

427
00:25:40,018 --> 00:25:41,645
I'm gonna go meet up
with someone right now.

428
00:25:41,728 --> 00:25:42,980
[Dokyung] They're gonna give me
some money.

429
00:25:43,647 --> 00:25:44,648
[Dokyung] It's a lot.

430
00:25:44,731 --> 00:25:46,400
Enough for us to leave
this place for good.

431
00:25:46,483 --> 00:25:47,776
A billion won.

432
00:25:47,860 --> 00:25:50,529
-Huh?
-[Dokyung] I'll be right back, okay?

433
00:25:50,612 --> 00:25:51,947
You stay here and wait in the van.

434
00:25:52,030 --> 00:25:53,282
[Dokyung] Then when I call you
on this phone,

435
00:25:53,365 --> 00:25:54,908
all you have to do is bring the van
to the place I tell you.

436
00:25:54,992 --> 00:25:56,785
Wait, what-what are you talking...

437
00:25:56,869 --> 00:25:58,662
[Dokyung] It's not far.
Just listen to me!

438
00:25:58,745 --> 00:25:59,746
If I don't...

439
00:26:00,831 --> 00:26:03,167
If you haven't received a call
from me by midnight,

440
00:26:03,250 --> 00:26:05,085
then take this van and run away.

441
00:26:05,169 --> 00:26:06,753
[Dokyung] And ditch the phone.

442
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:10,883
As long as you have that casket,
they won't be able to hurt me.

443
00:26:10,966 --> 00:26:12,634
Who are you meeting with?

444
00:26:12,718 --> 00:26:15,137
And what the hell is in that thing?

445
00:26:15,220 --> 00:26:17,598
-Seriously, just tell me what's going on!
-It'll all be over soon.

446
00:26:17,681 --> 00:26:19,433
-You don't need to know about this, Heeju.
-[Heeju] Why?

447
00:26:19,516 --> 00:26:20,893
What aren't you telling me?

448
00:26:24,646 --> 00:26:25,981
[Heeju] Dokyung.

449
00:26:26,064 --> 00:26:29,610
[Heeju] Listen, I will do exactly
as you say.

450
00:26:29,693 --> 00:26:31,904
That's exactly why I need to know.

451
00:26:31,987 --> 00:26:33,655
[Heeju] What am I doing and why?

452
00:26:34,239 --> 00:26:35,240
[Heeju exhales]

453
00:26:35,324 --> 00:26:36,742
[Dokyung sighs]

454
00:26:37,492 --> 00:26:38,952
I'll explain everything later.

455
00:26:39,745 --> 00:26:41,163
When it's over,

456
00:26:41,246 --> 00:26:43,165
the two of us should go to France.

457
00:26:43,248 --> 00:26:44,750
A fresh start.
We'll forget all this.

458
00:26:44,833 --> 00:26:48,086
We can finally be happy. Okay?

459
00:26:48,170 --> 00:26:49,463
I'm begging you.

460
00:26:50,464 --> 00:26:51,465
Please.

461
00:26:53,884 --> 00:26:54,885
[exhales]

462
00:26:59,431 --> 00:27:01,016
[exhales sharply]

463
00:27:01,099 --> 00:27:02,726
Thank you.

464
00:27:03,894 --> 00:27:06,605
[Dokyung] I'll be back.
Just be careful.

465
00:27:09,733 --> 00:27:11,109
[car door opens]

466
00:27:13,403 --> 00:27:14,404
[car door closes]

467
00:27:15,697 --> 00:27:19,451
[♪ dramatic music]

468
00:27:20,535 --> 00:27:21,620
[exhales]

469
00:27:22,746 --> 00:27:25,749
[crickets chirping]
STYLE
::cue()

470
00:27:48,647 --> 00:27:50,148
[car engine revving]

471
00:27:50,232 --> 00:27:51,400
[grunts]

472
00:27:51,483 --> 00:27:53,151
[tires squealing]

473
00:27:54,111 --> 00:27:55,112
[gasps]

474
00:28:07,833 --> 00:28:09,584
Shit.

475
00:28:10,961 --> 00:28:12,671
[Gitae] He must be dead, right?

476
00:28:12,754 --> 00:28:14,965
I hit him pretty damn hard.

477
00:28:20,387 --> 00:28:23,557
[Hocheol] Hey! Go over
and search every inch of the place!

478
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,142
It's there somewhere.

479
00:28:25,809 --> 00:28:28,520
-[Gitae] Get going! Run!
-Ah, fuck.

480
00:28:30,397 --> 00:28:33,400
[whimpering]

481
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,611
[Thug E] Hurry up.

482
00:28:41,158 --> 00:28:44,161
[tires squealing]

483
00:28:52,753 --> 00:28:54,046
[exhales sharply]

484
00:28:55,172 --> 00:28:56,840
[doors creaking]

485
00:28:57,674 --> 00:28:59,176
[keys jingling]

486
00:29:03,013 --> 00:29:04,931
[creaking]

487
00:29:07,642 --> 00:29:10,645
[gasping and crying]

488
00:29:11,855 --> 00:29:15,275
[cell phone vibrating]

489
00:29:21,114 --> 00:29:23,617
[Dokyung breathing heavily]

490
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:26,953
-[Dokyung] Run away, Heeju.
-Dokyung.

491
00:29:27,788 --> 00:29:28,830
[Dokyung] I'm sorry.

492
00:29:28,914 --> 00:29:31,625
What? No, no, no.
Dokyung, are you there?

493
00:29:32,459 --> 00:29:33,794
Please don't go!

494
00:29:33,877 --> 00:29:35,837
Dokyung, are you there?
Please don't go!

495
00:29:35,921 --> 00:29:37,339
Don't...

496
00:29:38,673 --> 00:29:42,260
[crying]

497
00:29:55,774 --> 00:29:56,775
[exhales]

498
00:30:15,794 --> 00:30:18,797
[crying]

499
00:30:19,923 --> 00:30:21,133
[door rattling]

500
00:30:22,300 --> 00:30:25,303
[scraping]

501
00:31:06,303 --> 00:31:09,306
[yanking on door handle]

502
00:31:17,439 --> 00:31:20,442
[phone trilling]

503
00:31:21,109 --> 00:31:22,444
Sir, I found the van.

504
00:31:23,278 --> 00:31:26,281
Yeah, it's in the warehouse
at the top on the right.

505
00:31:27,324 --> 00:31:28,742
[whimpers]

506
00:31:29,701 --> 00:31:31,077
Okay, you stay put.

507
00:31:32,162 --> 00:31:33,330
Hey, boss!

508
00:31:33,413 --> 00:31:34,748
[Gitae] They found the van!

